{"sha":"afbec38df7403927a5633b7f121eebecd243d44b","node_id":"C_kwDOTlG2EtoAKGFmYmVjMzhkZjc0MDM5MjdhNTYzM2I3ZjEyMWVlYmVjZDI0M2Q0NGI","commit":{"author":{"name":"Vladimir Reshetnikov","email":"v.reshetnikov@gmail.com","date":"2026-10-26T18:43:01Z"},"committer":{"name":"Vladimir Reshetnikov","email":"v.reshetnikov@gmail.com","date":"2026-10-26T18:43:01Z"},"message":"Derive cyclic rotation from convolution with a single impulse\n\nSpecialize word_convolution to Pi.single t 1 and simplify the resulting word and convolution. Remove seventeen lines of repeated reindexing and modular-power arithmetic. All rotation, carry and partial-phase definitions and original assumptions remain unchanged, including radix one and length one cases.\n\nValidation with the accompanying degree refactor: both fresh modules, four direct clients and one planned uncached NativeCyclicCarry prerequisite, four existing focused checks and the final twenty-two-result public axiom comparison pass. Independent complete-source/convolution/edge-case review passes. Native Boolean phase and non-Boolean carry controls are retained.","tree":{"sha":"d8dcb5b73263664ebe4b218f5e3efd388089a1cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VladimirReshetnikov/ProveIt/git/trees/d8dcb5b73263664ebe4b218f5e3efd388089a1cc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VladimirReshetnikov/ProveIt/git/commits/afbec38df7403927a5633b7f121eebecd243d44b","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VladimirReshetnikov/ProveIt/commits/afbec38df7403927a5633b7f121eebecd243d44b","html_url":"https://github.com/VladimirReshetnikov/ProveIt/commit/afbec38df7403927a5633b7f121eebecd243d44b","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VladimirReshetnikov/ProveIt/commits/afbec38df7403927a5633b7f121eebecd243d44b/comments","author":{"login":"VladimirReshetnikov","id":1231606,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMzE2MDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githu